Prediction of adsorption energy using molecular descriptor generated by RDKit. Calculated adsorption energies and ML features data. In Eads_35_features_model_comparison.xlsx file, there are multiple tabs, including inital raw RDKit features data, then data pre-processing, multicollinearity checks, final feature selection based on the feature importance and then the various model comparison using shortlisted 35 features. Please check each tab one by one.
